Write an optimized HIP kernel implementation for AMD MI300X: block_id to matrix tile idx (m0, n0) mapping are controlled by {M01, N01}

Function signature: __host__ __device__ static constexpr bool
    CheckValidity(const AGridDesc_K0_M_K1& a_grid_desc_k0_m_k1,
                  const BGridDesc_K0_N_K1& b_grid_desc_k0_n_k1,
