Write an optimized HIP kernel implementation for AMD MI300X: gridwise sparse embeddings forward layernorm (gpu / grid / gridwise sparse embeddings forward layernorm.hpp)

Function signature: __device__ static void Run(OutType* p_out,
                               const ck::Array<EmbType*, NumEmbeddings> p_embs,
                               const ck::Array<IndexType*, NumEmbeddings> p_indexes,
